    "long_instructions": "# Mars Rover Mission\r\n\r\nAnalyze the rover’s environmental conditions and energy use during its mission.\r\n\r\n1. Run the starter code and review the dataset information and statistics.\r\n2. Use `min()`, `max()`, and `sum()` to analyze temperature, solar radiation, dust levels, and battery usage.\r\n3. Use `agg()` to calculate the total, average, minimum, and maximum values for each metric.\r\n4. Discuss the trends or relationships you notice and form a hypothesis about what may have influenced the rover’s performance.\r\n\r\n:::: details [Need Help?]\r\n\r\nAsk AI Tutor for an example, documentation, or an explanation of the code or output. Use its guidance to complete the work yourself.\r\n\r\n::::",
